#: applications/luci-app-aurora-config/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aurora/gallery.js:1673
msgid "This key is your account. Anyone who has it can publish under your name and delete what you have shared."
msgstr "Kunci ini adalah akun Anda. Siapa pun yang memilikinya bisa membagikan atas nama Anda dan menghapus bagikan Anda."

#: applications/luci-app-aurora-config/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/aurora/gallery.js:2146
